{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"32954","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v37097","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"八島タカヒロ","creatorId":"vndb:s3699","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:14743","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3699","name":"八島タカヒロ","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:252690","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"基井あゆむ","creatorId":"vndb:s3700","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:14744","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3700","name":"基井あゆむ","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:252691","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"紺野アスタ","creatorId":"vndb:s1641","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:13862","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1641","name":"紺野アスタ","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:252692","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"Yow(網野コハク、amino)","creatorId":"vndb:s3974","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:16346","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3974","name":"Yow(網野コハク、amino)","detail":"ディレクター","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:252693","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"Yow","creatorId":"vndb:s3974","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3974","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3974","name":"Yow","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:186854","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c21753","characterName":"ハット","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"136383","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"29011"},{"characterId":"136383","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"47213"}],"egsCharacterIds":["138"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21753"},"originalCharacterName":"ハット","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A duck who lives in Kotori's room at the dorm, he has been there longer than anyone else. Has a love of cucumbers."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He was brought to the dorm by Misagi Isuka, the girl who once lived in Kotori's room."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21753"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"コールダックという小さな種類のアヒル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"碧が来た時には、すでに寮に住みついていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰が飼ってるわけでもなくそこにいる謎のアヒル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は、イスカが招き入れたという過去がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小鳥に懐いていて、車椅子の膝に乗ったり、一緒にお風呂に入ったりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰かが作ったお手製のシルクハットをかぶっているので “ハット” と呼ばれている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"136383"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7fcc8438b51bd0094a725dc8330aefe30e1dbeafa4cfe563257b2df24497e81.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f30fd4eba251b5b6e5a1f03d2ad8d5421ec0b2a35ba0e75c978c5096c87bdf00.webp","width":256,"height":153,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c9333","characterName":"羽々音 小鳥","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16051","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"102681"},{"characterId":"16051","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"29011"},{"characterId":"16051","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"47213"}],"egsCharacterIds":["126"],"vndbCharacterId":"c9333"},"originalCharacterName":"羽々音 小鳥","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"81"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A beautiful girl bound to a wheelchair. She is a slender girl with long, black hair and a tidy appearance but is strong-willed and speaks with confidence. Also, a crybaby. Because she transferred to Keifuu Academy for the simple reason that she is unable to move her legs and Keifuu Academy is completely barrier free, she has no interests in classes which teach specialty fields. Because of this, she is completely cut off from those around her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c9333"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子寮の問題児な車椅子の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"黒髪ロングの華奢で清楚な外見だが、話す言葉は強情で強気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"グライダー部では部長として、目標に向かって突き進む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"脚が怪我で動かせないという理由のみで、完全バリアフリーな恵風学園にやってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、専門的な分野を教える授業に興味がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親から「寮に足の不自由な子がいるから、面倒みてあげて」と言われ、主人公は女子寮の一番の問題児である彼女に、なんだかんだと世話を焼くようになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"126","sourceWorkId":"16506","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"轮椅美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拥有纤细的黑色长发、外表很清秀。但言语之中透露着坚强和倔强。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"而且是一个爱掉眼泪的人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为腿脚无法行动而来到对残疾人无障碍的恵風学園，但对专业领域的授课没有兴趣。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"为此，特别显眼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公碧因为被母亲告知「寝室里有行动不便的学生，帮忙照顾一下」，所以对女生宿舍里最有困难的小鳥各方面都颇为照顾。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16051"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b066cb3fdcec9384db798f55575b3ca3d56a03b70051bbd3a97423e35dc16cbb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a712284808eee090afbc6430fd5de4d330bed0365ea36650d921e2e7b960fe3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c9334","characterName":"姫城 あげは","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16052","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"102681"},{"characterId":"16052","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"29011"},{"characterId":"16052","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"47213"}],"egsCharacterIds":["127"],"vndbCharacterId":"c9334"},"originalCharacterName":"姫城 あげは","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A fashionable, cheerful, beautiful young girl who has a playfully flirtatious air about her. As she is good with her hands, she belongs to the Robotics Club but will soon join the Soaring Club."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She once had feelings Aoi, and despite being confessed to by Aoi she rejected him. She might even like him now. After five long years, they will meet again."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c9334"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"かれこれ5年ぶりの再会になる、主人公の幼馴染で初恋の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元気に明るく、少しだけさばさば系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔はボーイッシュな元気少女だったが、おしゃれに目覚め、現在はコケティッシュな雰囲気の明るい美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"手先が器用なので、主に機体などの制作を担当することになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ロボット部に所属するが、やがてグライダー部との掛け持ちになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつて主人公のことが好きだったが、告白されたくせにフッたという過去を持つ"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"127","sourceWorkId":"16506","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"时隔五年再次相见的青梅竹马。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以前是个男孩子气的活力少女，现在在打扮方面觉醒变成了娇媚开朗的美少女。意外地还是个巨乳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为手工出色加入机器人部，不久之后兼任加入滑翔部。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"碧、あげは、ほたる、柾次、あんちゃん五个人都是青梅竹马。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小时候喜欢碧，但被碧告白后却甩了他。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"现在大概还是喜欢。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16052"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/86/864b21e3057b539746625520e92e410863f9f09671757662fc2974023c1f7273.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/67a44353288c4eef0e941155f12e2eb77517dae93b2f7c9045eb77da1af00f68.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c9335","characterName":"望月 天音","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16053","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"102681"},{"characterId":"16053","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"29011"},{"characterId":"16053","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"47213"}],"egsCharacterIds":["128"],"vndbCharacterId":"c9335"},"originalCharacterName":"望月 天音","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A tall, gorgeous, and very stylish girl. When quiet, she is beautiful and seems kind, but can be somewhat of an airhead. She is the sole member of Keifuu Academy’s Soaring Club. She continues to enroll in school even after many years in order to complete the self-built glider for her best friend. Although she's a genius, she can be quite clumsy when things are not going so well."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c9335"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の伝説超留年生・超絶美人なグライダー部の先輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何年も学園にい続けているという伝説を持つ先輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見はすらりと背の高い超絶美人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"黙っていれば優しげな美人だが、根は結構天然系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やや男っぽいしゃべり方をする天才肌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自作のグライダーを作り、飛行実験を繰り返している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なんでもこなせる凄い人(ただし実務、実技は除く)。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生たちは当然、教師たちも口をはさめない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"128","sourceWorkId":"16506","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"只是滑翔部的一员。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"传说中待在学园里好几年的前辈。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"实际业务、实用技术以外样样精通的厉害人物。不仅仅是学生，就连教师都赞不绝口。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身材苗条高挑，是个体型优美的超级美人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"沉默的话是一个和善美人，有着天然系性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"为了完成自制的滑翔机而一直保留学籍。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但是，由于笨手笨脚加上不会操作，所以进展不太顺利。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16053"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec658cfbc40c31fb27683940b4ebf094fb0aafbb022b75d4f14083333013cda8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e3e3bca6d3f4c8914ed074fe0df2e2c15d1ad20eedeb87c13618484131647aac.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c9336","characterName":"風戸 亜紗","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16065","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"102681"},{"characterId":"16065","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"29011"},{"characterId":"16065","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"47213"}],"egsCharacterIds":["129"],"vndbCharacterId":"c9336"},"originalCharacterName":"風戸 亜紗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"77"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"150"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Asa is a girl with a bright and warm atmosphere. She can be a little clumsy, and a bit of an airhead but even those values are attractive. Asa, who can get along with anyone, helps others get along with each other as well. With her sister Yoru, they provide their secret base as a garage for the glider."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c9336"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"理事長の孫で一卵性双生児の姉妹の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女らが引っ越してきたとき、本来入居するはずの寮の空き部屋はグライダー置き場になっていて入れなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな経緯で、双子は自分たちの秘密基地をグライダーのガレージとして提供する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るくほんわかとした雰囲気の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少しドジで少し天然だが、そんなところも魅力的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰とでも仲良くなれる亜紗は、仲間内の潤滑油的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言い換えればペット。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"129","sourceWorkId":"16506","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"依留的双胞胎姐姐。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为是同卵双生，所以姐妹姿容非常相似。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"是个开朗温和的少女。稍微有些迟钝又常常做白日梦，但这方面也很有魅力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不管和谁都能友好相处的亜紗就像朋友圈里的润滑油。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"换句话说就是宠儿般的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当她们刚刚搬进寝室的时候，本来应该住人的寝室却变成了无法入住的滑翔机存放处。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为这样的原因，亜紗提供了她们自己当做秘密基地的设施作为滑翔机机库。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16065"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0dbf28c503552752e6127f6d98e16274db1e6ed05655abdd7fcca7699c0e29db.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/109c8c596fe49de676b62296f1bfc8689bdf0180708003016ba776e7c8da4568.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c9337","characterName":"風戸 依瑠","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16066","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"102681"},{"characterId":"16066","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"29011"},{"characterId":"16066","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"47213"}],"egsCharacterIds":["130"],"vndbCharacterId":"c9337"},"originalCharacterName":"風戸 依瑠","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"77"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"150"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rather indifferent about others, and a bit of a nihilist. A girl with a cool personality, with her head up in the clouds. She tries not to get close to others, but is emotionally attached to her twin sister Asa. Because she is a genius and does not like doing pointless things, she is rather pessimistic in regards to the Soaring Club. Her grandfather is the chairman of the school which Aoi and the others attend."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c9337"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"理事長の孫で一卵性双生児の姉妹の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天才肌で無駄なことを嫌うため、グライダー部の活動には否定的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、亜紗が入部してしまったため、しぶしぶといった態度でグライダー作りを手伝っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気だるげでややニヒリスト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールな正確で飄々とした雰囲気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"みんなとあまり馴染もうとしないが、姉の亜紗にはなついている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好みや思考など、亜紗とは対照的。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"130","sourceWorkId":"16506","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"亜紗的双胞胎妹妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"祖父是碧一行所在学园的理事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内向又有点虚无主义，性格冷静。即使在轻松的氛围中也不大适应和大家在一起。总是粘着姐姐亜紗。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"无论是爱好或者思考都和亜紗正好相反。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为讨厌从头到尾浪费时间，不赞同滑翔部的活动。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但是因为亜紗的入部，勉强帮着制作滑翔机。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16066"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/462cd37a7e4e43ab211302905713c438b615fbc976c70f1d603e2b81f68bf496.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c41808ed3f5cb5a10ccdbef3849666a20edfd61f8d49fd305a00ed728d8fae4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c9338","characterName":"水瀬 碧","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16067","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"29011"},{"characterId":"16067","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"47213"}],"egsCharacterIds":["131"],"vndbCharacterId":"c9338"},"originalCharacterName":"水瀬 碧","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"174"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Aoi is a boy who has returned to his hometown of Kazegaura as a result of a cycling race accident. He had intended on returning to his parents’ home but was made the manager of Keifuu Academy’s girls’ dormitory by his mother who manages the dormitory. Through meeting Kotori, he begins getting back the passion he once had and pushes forward."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c9338"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"小时候住在風ヶ浦，因为双亲的关系搬家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"这次回到了阔别数年的故乡。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然碧打算住在自己家，但被母亲强迫当了其所管理的女生宿舍的管理员。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"碧家务万能，料理技术高超，并且一旦开始打扫便会沉迷其中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近因为某件事情稍显悲观失望，但自从和小鳥相遇并开始照顾她之后一点一点变得乐观了。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原本他有着满腔热血、任何事情都灵活乐观应对的性格。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16067"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7d3f51f1a5ebbfea327ac194394978281c08692e696cdd451a439e7b6d788fc8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e0938806cfb02cdc2740acd6ed4aed38a650b45517e9e33fa4c25d146cfe4aa9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c10981","characterName":"美鷺 イスカ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c10981"},"originalCharacterName":"美鷺 イスカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The best friend of Amane. She promised her to take her up on the Morning Glory but it never happened due to an accident. She hides the fact that she has a frail constitution from her friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10981"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e79ef778b696978094285802fdaeaf01260a42c1f3bc4f8711e43e3ec91f835a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c2be9069f074fa551978ae5e263dfbc8405a98ec37e80e1499109901a036e1f9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p76","sourceCompanyId":"egs